{"seq":1,"slug":"sensor-classification","title":"传感器分类与特性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/sensing/sensor-classification","wordCount":1813,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"传感器分类与特性\">传感器分类与特性</h1><p>一个把房间温度报给空调的热敏电阻、一个把方向盘转角报给转向系统的霍尔编码器、一个把心跳报给手表的光电容积脉搏波模块——它们形态各异，却共享同一件事：把某种物理世界的量，变成电路能读懂的电信号。要在成百上千种器件里做选型，靠的不是记住型号，而是用一套统一的语言去描述「它把什么转成什么」以及「转得有多准、多快、多稳」。这一篇就是建立这套语言：先把传感器按能量与转换方式归类，再用静态与动态指标把任意一只传感器的性能钉死成可比较的数字。后续各篇——无论是<a href=\"physical-quantity-sensing\">物理量传感</a>的具体机理，还是<a href=\"../interface/signal-conditioning\">信号调理电路</a>对微弱输出的放大——都建立在这套指标之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>传感器（sensor）是把被测量（measurand）转换为可用输出信号的器件。最有用的第一刀分类，是看它转换时是否需要外部能量：<strong>无源传感器</strong>（自源型，self-generating）自己把被测量的能量直接转成电能，例如热电偶靠塞贝克效应产生电动势、压电晶体受力产生电荷；<strong>有源传感器</strong>（调制型，modulating）则用外部激励，被测量去调制这个激励的某个参数，例如应变片靠桥路电压把电阻变化读出来、电容式位移传感器靠交流激励读出电容变化。</p>\n<p>第二刀按输出信号形态分：模拟输出（连续电压/电流/电阻/电容）与数字输出（已在芯片内完成<a href=\"../interface/adc-sampling\">ADC 转换</a>并经<a href=\"../interface/sensor-interfaces-buses\">总线</a>送出）。第三刀按转换所依赖的物理效应分，这是工程师最常用的归类维度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[被测量 measurand] --&gt; B{需要外部激励?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否 自源型| C[热电偶 塞贝克效应&lt;br/&gt;压电 压电效应&lt;br/&gt;光伏 光生伏特]&#10;  B --&gt;|是 调制型| D[应变片 压阻效应&lt;br/&gt;电容式 介电变化&lt;br/&gt;霍尔 洛伦兹力]&#10;  C --&gt; E[转换为电压/电荷]&#10;  D --&gt; F[激励被调制 经桥路/解调读出]&#10;  E --&gt; G[信号调理]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[ADC 与数字接口]\">graph TD\n  A[被测量 measurand] --&gt; B{需要外部激励?}\n  B --&gt;|否 自源型| C[热电偶 塞贝克效应&lt;br/&gt;压电 压电效应&lt;br/&gt;光伏 光生伏特]\n  B --&gt;|是 调制型| D[应变片 压阻效应&lt;br/&gt;电容式 介电变化&lt;br/&gt;霍尔 洛伦兹力]\n  C --&gt; E[转换为电压/电荷]\n  D --&gt; F[激励被调制 经桥路/解调读出]\n  E --&gt; G[信号调理]\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[ADC 与数字接口]</pre><p>下表把常见的物理效应、典型器件与所测量对应起来，作为后续选型的速查骨架。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>物理效应</th>\n<th>典型器件</th>\n<th>所测被测量</th>\n<th>输出性质</th>\n<th>主讲篇目</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>塞贝克效应</td>\n<td>热电偶</td>\n<td>温度</td>\n<td>自源（mV 级电压）</td>\n<td><a href=\"physical-quantity-sensing\">物理量传感</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压阻效应</td>\n<td>应变片、压力传感器</td>\n<td>力、压力、应变</td>\n<td>调制（电阻变化）</td>\n<td><a href=\"physical-quantity-sensing\">物理量传感</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压电效应</td>\n<td>加速度计、声呐</td>\n<td>振动、动态力</td>\n<td>自源（电荷）</td>\n<td><a href=\"../actuators/electromagnetic-piezo\">电磁与压电执行器</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>霍尔效应</td>\n<td>电流/位置传感器</td>\n<td>磁场、电流、转角</td>\n<td>调制（电压）</td>\n<td><a href=\"physical-quantity-sensing\">物理量传感</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光电效应</td>\n<td>光电二极管、CMOS</td>\n<td>光强、图像</td>\n<td>调制/自源</td>\n<td><a href=\"photo-imaging-sensing\">光电与成像传感</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"静态特性-稳态下传感器到底准不准\">静态特性：稳态下传感器到底准不准</h2><p>当被测量缓慢变化、可视为稳态时，描述输入输出关系的指标统称静态特性。<strong>量程（range）</strong> 是允许测量的上下限；<strong>灵敏度（sensitivity）</strong> 是输出变化对输入变化之比，对线性传感器即标定曲线的斜率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\mathrm{d}y/\\mathrm{d}x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>准确性方面有三个常被混淆的词。<strong>非线性度</strong> 衡量实际标定曲线偏离理想直线的最大偏差，常以满量程的百分比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm x\\% \\mathrm{FS}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">FS</span></span></span></span></span></span> 表示。<strong>迟滞（hysteresis）</strong> 是同一输入在升程与降程时输出不一致的程度，源于材料的弹性滞后或磁滞。<strong>重复性（repeatability）</strong> 是同方向多次测量同一输入时输出的离散程度。</p>\n<p>要特别区分<strong>精度（accuracy）</strong> 与<strong>精密度（precision）</strong>：精度是测量值贴近真值的程度（系统误差小），精密度是多次测量彼此贴近的程度（随机误差小）。一只系统性偏高 5 ℃ 但每次都偏 5 ℃ 的传感器，精密度高而精度低，可以靠标定修正；反之随机跳变的传感器无法靠简单标定挽救。<strong>分辨率（resolution）</strong> 是能分辨的最小输入增量，对数字输出器件常受限于<a href=\"../interface/adc-sampling\">ADC 的量化台阶</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动态特性-变化的量跟不跟得上\">动态特性：变化的量跟不跟得上</h2><p>当被测量快速变化时，传感器的输出会滞后甚至失真，这由其动态特性决定。绝大多数传感器可近似为一阶或二阶系统。</p>\n<p>一阶系统（如裸露热电偶的热响应）由时间常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 刻画，对阶跃输入其输出为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y(t) = y_\\infty \\left(1 - e^{-t/\\tau}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>经过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 才达到稳态的 99%。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 越小，跟随越快。带保护套管的热电偶 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 可达数秒，意味着它根本无法捕捉毫秒级的温度跳变。</p>\n<p>二阶系统（如压电加速度计、压力膜片）由自然频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\omega_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与阻尼比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ζ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\zeta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">ζ</span></span></span></span></span> 刻画。欠阻尼（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ζ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\zeta &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">ζ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）时阶跃响应会过冲并振荡，临界阻尼（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ζ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\zeta = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">ζ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）时最快无过冲到位。频域上，传感器有一段平坦的可用带宽，超过后增益滚降、相位畸变。这就是为什么测振动要先看加速度计的谐振频率：使用带宽通常只取谐振频率的 1/5 到 1/3。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>系统阶数</th>\n<th>关键参数</th>\n<th>典型器件</th>\n<th>失真表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一阶</td>\n<td>时间常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>热电偶、热敏电阻</td>\n<td>快变信号被「抹平」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二阶</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\omega_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ζ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\zeta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">ζ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>加速度计、压力膜片</td>\n<td>谐振附近过冲、相位畸变</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"标定-误差预算与选型决策\">标定、误差预算与选型决策</h2><p>把上述指标变成可信数字的过程叫<strong>标定（calibration）</strong>：用已知精度的基准（其不确定度应优于被标器件 3 到 10 倍）施加一系列已知输入，记录输出，拟合传递函数并量化残差。现代智能传感器常在出厂时把多点标定系数写入芯片内 EEPROM，上电后由内部逻辑自动补偿温漂与非线性——这也是数字输出器件标称精度远高于其裸敏感元件的原因。</p>\n<p>工程上把所有误差源汇总成<strong>误差预算（error budget）</strong>。各独立随机误差按方根和（RSS）合成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mtext>lin</mtext><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mtext>hys</mtext><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mtext>temp</mtext><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mtext>noise</mtext><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_\\text{total} = \\sqrt{\\sigma_\\text{lin}^2 + \\sigma_\\text{hys}^2 + \\sigma_\\text{temp}^2 + \\sigma_\\text{noise}^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.84em;vertical-align:-0.6269em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2131em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.8em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lin</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hys</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4374em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4542em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">temp</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4173em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">noise</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2827em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1731em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.88em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.88em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1944\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M983 90\nl0 -0\nc4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000v40\nH1013.1s-83.4,268,-264.1,840c-180.7,572,-277,876.3,-289,913c-4.7,4.7,-12.7,7,-24,7\ns-12,0,-12,0c-1.3,-3.3,-3.7,-11.7,-7,-25c-35.3,-125.3,-106.7,-373.3,-214,-744\nc-10,12,-21,25,-33,39s-32,39,-32,39c-6,-5.3,-15,-14,-27,-26s25,-30,25,-30\nc26.7,-32.7,52,-63,76,-91s52,-60,52,-60s208,722,208,722\nc56,-175.3,126.3,-397.3,211,-666c84.7,-268.7,153.8,-488.2,207.5,-658.5\nc53.7,-170.3,84.5,-266.8,92.5,-289.5z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6269em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>选型时按这条链做决策：先用量程和带宽筛掉跟不上的（动态特性），再用精度与分辨率筛掉不够准的（静态特性），最后看温漂、长期稳定性与供电、封装、接口是否匹配系统。值得记住的是，敏感元件本身往往不是误差主导，<a href=\"../interface/signal-conditioning\">信号调理</a>引入的噪声与失调、以及 ADC 的量化与基准漂移常常才是误差预算里的大头。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>第一刀分类看是否需外部激励：自源型（热电偶、压电）直接产能，调制型（应变片、电容式、霍尔）靠激励被调制。</li>\n<li>静态特性回答「稳态准不准」：量程、灵敏度、非线性、迟滞、重复性；务必区分精度（贴近真值）与精密度（彼此贴近），以及分辨率（最小可分辨增量）。</li>\n<li>动态特性回答「快变跟不跟得上」：一阶看时间常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>，二阶看自然频率与阻尼比，使用带宽远低于谐振频率。</li>\n<li>标定把指标钉成数字，误差预算用 RSS 合成；真实系统里调理电路与 ADC 常是误差主导，而非敏感元件本身。</li>\n<li>这套指标语言贯穿全 hub：具体机理见<a href=\"physical-quantity-sensing\">物理量传感</a>与<a href=\"photo-imaging-sensing\">光电成像</a>，信号链见<a href=\"../interface/signal-conditioning\">信号调理</a>与<a href=\"../interface/adc-sampling\">ADC 采样</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"传感器分类与特性","id":"传感器分类与特性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"静态特性：稳态下传感器到底准不准","id":"静态特性-稳态下传感器到底准不准"},{"level":2,"text":"动态特性：变化的量跟不跟得上","id":"动态特性-变化的量跟不跟得上"},{"level":2,"text":"标定、误差预算与选型决策","id":"标定-误差预算与选型决策"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"物理量传感","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/sensing/physical-quantity-sensing"}}